00:04:10.675 --> 00:04:14.180
<v Host>It means a changeover — one taking the place of another.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:26.516
<v Slow>新しいキャラクターの候補は、リスのような「A」、ウサギのような「B」、モグラの「C」の3つです。

00:04:27.315 --> 00:04:33.004
<v Host>There are three candidates: one like a squirrel, one like a rabbit, and a mole.

